# Descriptor: [B- -> anti-D_10 l- nu, anti-D_10 -> anti-D0 pi+ pi- pi0] gap mode
# NickName: Bu_D1lnu_D0pipipi_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; three-pion contribution to semileptonic gap via D_1(2420).
#   Paper (arXiv:2605.03021) attributes up to 1/4 of the DXlnu gap to three-pion modes,
#   primarily D_1*(2760)->D_1(2420)pi and D_2(2800)->D_2*(2460)pi sequential decays.
#   Neither 2760 nor 2800 exist in evt.pdl; we use D_1(2420) as the intermediate state
#   with LLSW for B -> D_1 l nu and PHSP for D_1 -> D pi pi pi (3-body approximation).
#   The D_1 -> D pipi modes are in DECAY_BELLE2.DEC; the extra pi comes from the
#   unmeasured higher sequential decay. This is a rough placeholder.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260519

Alias D1pipipisig anti-D_10
Alias anti-D1pipipisig D_10
ChargeConj D1pipipisig anti-D1pipipisig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 D1pipipisig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D1pipipisig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

SetLineshapePW D1pipipisig anti-D*0 pi0 2
SetLineshapePW D1pipipisig D*- pi+ 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1pipipisig D*0 pi0 2
SetLineshapePW anti-D1pipipisig D*+ pi- 2

Decay D1pipipisig
1.0   anti-D0  pi+  pi-  pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D1pipipisig

End
